After utilizing the penalty method, the problem $\mathcal{P}_{5}$ is still hard to handle because of the non-convex constraints. We then propose a two-layer iterative algorithm to deal with the inner and outer layers. The penalized problem is tackled through the alternating optimization method in the inner layer, while the penalty factor is updated in the outer layer.

