to verify the convergence of the proposed algorithm. Fig.~\ref{fig_penalty} shows the stopping indicator of the penalty method versus the total number of iterations in the outer layer. We observe that after about $120$ iterations, the stopping indicator $\xi$ can be met with the threshold $\varepsilon_4$, meaning that the equality constraints can always be satisfied. Also, as the SINR threshold $\beta_0$ rises, the number of iterations increases. 

