\section{Introduction}
\javier{Personalized advice plays a crucial role in our society, particularly in complex and high-stakes domains like healthcare and finance. Advisors and professionals in these fields use their expertise to offer personalized guidance and emotional support to their clients, leveraging people's specific preferences and/or circumstances. However, advisory services are often provided at a high cost, effectively excluding a large portion of the population from this critical advice. In the financial domain, to mitigate this issue, automated decision support systems have been widely studied, with a special focus on investment-related predictions, such as financial asset recommendations~\citep{javier,takayanagi}}.

