\looseness -1 \javier{First, the financial literature emphasizes that eliciting user preferences is central to delivering suitable advice~\cite{streich2023risk}. However, it remains unclear whether current conversational technologies, particularly those powered by LLMs, can correctly elicit user preferences in specialized domains where users struggle to articulate their needs. \takehiro{Our work addresses this challenge in the context of financial services.}} 

