\label{sec:methodology}

\subsection{Overview}
The architectural framework of LeAD is illustrated in Fig. 2. The dual-system decision architecture comprises two parallel subsystems: a high-frequency fast system based on an E2E network and a redundant low-frequency slow system utilizing a LLM, integrated through LeAD's asynchronous coupling mechanism.

