\textbf{Near-field imaging and environment sensing:}
% The high degree of controllability offered by near-field THz beams lays a solid foundation for advanced THz imaging and deep environmental sensing. 
% The multi-focal beam can be generated by superposition of multiple complex electric fields corresponding to separate focal points. 
