This method aims to find the $\boldsymbol{\hat{p}}_T$ and $\boldsymbol{\hat{\beta}}_B$ to minimize $\|\hat{E}_{P_T}-E_{P_T}(\boldsymbol{p}_T)\|_{F}$ and $\|\hat{E}_{P_B}-E_{P_B}(\boldsymbol{\beta}_T)\|_{F}$, respectively. 
