    \noindent \textbf{Opportunity \arabic{discussionCount}: Measurable Metrics for Automated License Violation Detection.} 
    %
    Current research on license risk detection in software management has predominantly focused on the more observable aspects such as the inclusion of licenses, copyrights, {notices}, and conflicts arising from contradictory licensing terms.
    {However, since these compliance requirements cannot be effectively measured, automated detection is infeasible, making manual review indispensable.}
