    {3) Regularly auditing third-party dependencies to verify that their licenses are compatible with the chosen license, by utilizing SCA tools, is also highly recommended. 
    Specifically, it is important to carefully keep an eye on the obligations and conditions to fulfill before integration, and tools at term-level~\cite{lidetector,DIKE,huang2024your} and existing license interpretation websites~\cite{tldrlegal, choosealicense}, can be helpful.}

