    5) Developers should also stay informed about licensing trends and best practices to address any emerging risks or conflicts proactively, helping to safeguard your project's legal integrity and reputation {(e.g., by following initiatives and discussion of OSI and the OpenChain Project~\cite{OPENCHAINACT})}.


